<title>JAPAN: Ricoh Seiki - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ricoh Seiki - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.47		vs	    9.40</p>
<p> Operating	  253    million	  vs	  326    million</p>
<p> Current	    274    million	  vs	  360    million</p>
<p> Net		   68    million	  vs	  167    million</p>
<p> EPS		    8.15 yen	  vs	   23.03 yen</p>
<p> Shares		8 million	  vs	   7 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.50 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Ricoh Seiki Co Ltd is a maker of LPG and water meters.</p>
